---
// Shown on every page through the Banner override. Keep the wording explicit:
// this site is a community proposal and must never read as an official channel.
---

<div class="isb-disclaimer" role="note" data-pagefind-ignore>
	<strong class="isb-stamp">Não oficial</strong>
	<span>
		Proposta comunitária. Este site não é mantido pelo Ministério da Saúde nem pelo DATASUS. Para informação
		oficial, consulte o{' '}
		<a href="https://servicos-datasus.saude.gov.br/">Portal de Serviços do DATASUS</a> e o{' '}
		<a href="https://hl7.org.br/fhir/core/">BR Core</a>.
	</span>
</div>

<style>
	.isb-disclaimer {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.875rem;
		padding: 0.5rem var(--sl-nav-pad-x);
		background: var(--isb-notice-bg);
		color: var(--isb-notice-text);
		border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--isb-notice-border);
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		line-height: 1.45;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}
	.isb-stamp {
		flex: none;
		border: 1.5px solid var(--isb-form-ink);
		padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem;
		font-family: var(--isb-font-display);
		font-stretch: 78%;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.6875rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--isb-form-ink);
		transform: rotate(-2deg);
	}
	.isb-disclaimer a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration-color: var(--isb-form-ink);
		text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
	}
	@media (max-width: 40rem) {
		.isb-disclaimer {
			justify-content: flex-start;
		}
	}
</style>
